      "writtenOn": "2017-11-29T07:25:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are some differences:\n1. In this case we don\u0027t provision the IGMP flows even if the enableDhcpIgmpOnProvisioning is true because user is asking to specifically create HSIA flows.\n2. If we use the provisionSubscriber() function from here, the s-tag used for the subscriber would be that of the olt (olt.vlan() is used inside that function), where as here we are using the s-tag which is configured for that particular subscriber. With this flexibility we can support subscribers with different S-tags on the same OLT.",
